{"version":1,"content":"<p>昨晚（3日）11時許，警方接獲一名男子報案，指在尖沙嘴亞士厘道10至14號住所發現遺失財物。</p><p>警方到場經調查，初步相信事主失去一批價值約27萬元的珠寶。</p><p>據悉，78歲印度裔男事主懷疑妻子與事件有關。</p><p>警方列作盜竊案處理，交由油尖警區刑事調查隊跟進。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T03:44:50.085520+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T03:23:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T19:18:20.462434+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T03:38:19.325855+00:00","content_hash":"bf12ea4871c6551973bf77ed711ccf494d6951dd70e88e5370a8e347415e6e5f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}